---
title: "Engine: steps, the history store, checkpoints and recovery"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: accepted
    lg1: attention
    lg2: Breaks AFaultCanBeExported
    lg3: Breaks OnlyRecoverContinuesAFaultedBranch in some cases
    lg4: Path to the AFaultCanBeExported or OnlyRecoverContinuesAFaultedBranch bug
  }
  class lg0 teal
  class lg1 orange
  class lg2 breaks
  class lg3 mayBreak
  class lg4 bugPath
  s0: Run at its accepted head
  s1: Engine fault, run stopped
  s2: Step refused, retry pending
  s3: Accepted head, a link waits for the store
  s4: Engine fault, exported and latched
  s5: Engine fault, a link waits for the store
  s6: Step refused, a link waits for the store
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: the solver core or the model cannot go on
  s0 --> s0: a checkpoint is taken
  s0 --> s2: refused whole, nothing changes
  s0 --> s3: accepted, the store refuses its link
  s1 --> s4: the fault is exported, latched
  s2 --> s1: no shorter interval is left
  s2 --> s0: the shorter retry is accepted or resume a checkpoint in a fresh solver core
  s2 --> s3: accepted, the store refuses its link
  s3 --> s5: the solver core or the model cannot go on
  s3 --> s6: refused whole, nothing changes
  s4 --> s0: recover on a new branch or resume a checkpoint in a fresh solver core
  s1 --> s0: resume a checkpoint in a fresh solver core or recover on a new branch
  s3 --> s0: resume a checkpoint in a fresh solver core or rewind on a new branch
  s6 --> s5: no shorter interval is left
  s5 --> s0: resume a checkpoint in a fresh solver core or recover on a new branch
  s6 --> s0: resume a checkpoint in a fresh solver core
  s0 --> s4: the solver core or the model cannot go on
  s2 --> s4: no shorter interval is left
  classDef breaks fill:#ffecee,stroke:#e72e3b,stroke-width:2.5px,color:#cd2834
  classDef mayBreak fill:#fff3e6,stroke:#e8730c,stroke-width:2.5px,color:#b85a06
  class s0 teal
  class s0 mayBreak
  class s0 bugPath
  class s1 orange
  class s1 bugPath
  class s2 orange
  class s3 teal
  class s3 mayBreak
  class s3 bugPath
  class s4 orange
  class s4 bugPath
  class s5 orange
  class s5 breaks
  class s5 bugPath
  class s6 orange
